    "en": {
      "trackName": "FrogHops - Pond Adventure",
      "description": "A hand-painted frog jumping game: hold to charge, leap across lily pads, and collect treasures. Play offline on iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch.\n\nFrogHops brings a hand-painted Chinese pond to iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch. Hold to charge, release to jump, and turn a quiet moment into a satisfying test of precision.\n\nHold anywhere on the pond to charge. Release to leap toward the next floating platform. Landing safely keeps your run alive; landing near the center earns more points; a perfect landing builds your precision streak and earns a petal.\n\nChoose your way to play: progress through 999 increasingly challenging Journey levels, score before time runs out, keep leaping in Endless mode, or challenge a friend on the same route on iPhone and iPad. Later routes introduce smaller targets, varied pond platforms, and mirages that can be revealed with earned petals.\n\nPetal darts are earned and used within each run. Reach floating coins and gems before they fade, then spend the gold on frogs in the Frog Shop. My Pond lists your collected items, their value, and owned frogs. Frog cards show their price and jump strength: stronger frogs leap farther with the same charge. Your available gold and owned frogs sync between paired devices. Choose between two complete visual worlds included from the start: the indigo-and-gold Moonlit Silk or the mint-and-peach Peach Mist. Themes change the presentation, never the physics, scoring, or leaderboard fairness.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• One-touch hold-and-release controls\n• Journey, Timed, and Endless on all three devices; Friend Challenge on iPhone and iPad\n• 999 levels with varied pond routes\n• 12 frogs to collect and an evolving My Pond\n• Two complete themes: Moonlit Silk and Peach Mist\n• Local records, with 8 Game Center leaderboards and 14 achievements on iPhone and iPad\n• Reduce Motion; Tap Charge on Apple Watch\n• Works offline; Game Center is optional\n• One-time purchase with no ads or in-app purchases\n\nFrogHops is made for iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch. The Watch app also plays independently.\n\n（\nLicense Agreement: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://nvwacity.com/froghops/privacy.html?\nTerms of Service: https://nvwacity.com/froghops/terms.html?lang=en\n）",
      "releaseNotes": "Submit leaderboards, achievements, challenges, and events to enhance the gaming experience.",
